WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.748
ALEX: So Gemini 4 Argon. Google's own
blog describes it as their most

00:00:04.748 --> 00:00:09.497
ALEX: powerful frontier model to date.
Not available to you, not available to

00:00:09.497 --> 00:00:14.246
ALEX: most developers. Only to a vetted
group of cyber defenders inside
something

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:18.994
ALEX: called the Fairwind Program.
Rufus, what does that framing tell you?

00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:21.629
RUFUS: It tells you that the most
consequential capability is also the one

00:00:21.629 --> 00:00:24.179
RUFUS: Google trusts the fewest people
to hold.

00:00:24.289 --> 00:00:28.318
JAMIE: Which they're calling safety-
first. I'd like to know the criteria for
being

00:00:28.318 --> 00:00:32.348
JAMIE: vetted, because that's doing a
lot of work in that sentence.
